   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Ambedkar's books – themes:** *Castes in India* (1916) – genesis and mechanism of the caste system; *Annihilation of Caste* (1936) – attack on caste (anti-caste); *Who Were the Shudras?* (1946) – origin of the Shudras; *The Untouchables* (1948) – origin of untouchability."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 114,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **ES 2025-26 on low mobility:** low social mobility **entrenches historical inequality**."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 114,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Why OBC demands:** dominant peasant castes such as **Marathas, Gujjars and Patels** seek OBC status mainly for **greater life chances** (jobs, education), not ritual rank."
  }
